msgstr ""
"So we add the ``styles/prosilver/template/event/"
"overall_header_navigation_prepend_listener.html`` to our extensions "
"directory and add our html code into it."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:769
msgid "And that's it. No file edits required for the template files as well."
msgstr "And that's it. No file edits required for the template files as well."

